<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-APN says still interested in Fairfax.</title>
<headline>RTRS-APN says still interested in Fairfax.</headline>
<dateline>BRISBANE 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australian Provincial Newspapers Holdings Ltd is still interested in becoming part of any bid for newspaper publisher John Fairfax Holdings Ltd, chief executive Cameron O'Reilly said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>&quot;We were obviously interested at one time and we are still obviously very interested in Fairfax,&quot; O'Reilly told a business breakfast meeting.</p>
</text>
